Modifications made by this project (per Apache-2.0 section 4):

  * The individual relationType concept files (Cites.jsonld, IsCitedBy.jsonld, ...),
    the ConceptScheme (relationType.jsonld) and the shared context (context.jsonld)
    have been combined into a single self-contained JSON-LD document, relationType.jsonld,
    with the @context inlined and the concepts collected under one @graph.
  * The combined document carries an "SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0" field and
    provenance fields ("_source", "_modifications").

The combined file is generated by build.py and refreshed automatically from upstream
